an invitation tomorrow.</br>\n<strong>Manager:</strong> Great! Now, what are you planning to explain in the meeting?</br>\n<strong>Engineer:</strong> Well, behind the multiple aspects that we have, there are others that we have to take into consideration.</br><br/>", "image": "enpe7n3le01ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 0}, {"time": "41000", "text": "<strong>Manager:</strong> How many aspects are there?<br/>\n<strong>Engineer:</strong> There's Data Accessibility. We are planning to explain data accessibility as those activities we relate to storing and creating reliable databases.<br/>\n<strong>Manager:</strong> How many facts can you list about data accessibility?<br/>\n<strong>Engineer: </strong>Well, there are some main facts in accessibility. First of all, data accessibility has to be reliable, assistances are working on the availability of information next week and they are using an e-commerce application next month, so they can have information updated 24 hours, 7 days a week.<br/>\n<strong>Manager:</strong> How much time and effort is necessary to accomplish that?<br/>", "image": "enpe7n3le01ob07re2img02.jpg", "id": 1}, {"time": "86000", "text": "<strong>Engineer:</strong> It is taking 24/7 but it is not taking too much effort next month with the application. The company is acquiring a robust system next Monday. We are also mirroring the database on multiple servers; and we are planning to create a backup on July that contains all the information we are storing and updating concurrently. <br/>\n<strong>Manager:</strong> How many procedures does the organization need to restore data?<br/>\n<strong>Engineer:</strong> There are just two procedures. There is an onsite backup procedure and there's an offsite backup procedure for restoring data.<br/>\n<strong>Manager: </strong>Great! So I'm seeing you tomorrow at the meeting!<br/>", "image": "enpe7n3le01ob07re2img03.jpg", "id": 2}], "audiosrc": "enpe7n3le01ob07re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "title": "", "id": 3, "type"